== General ==
Xlixinar Arcut and Drixiv Arcut are on [[Legion of Cabilis]] faction, and are located at the {{loc|The Overthere|-1407, -1397|South East tip}} of the Overthere chasm. The quests can be completed by anyone given sufficient faction.

With the exception of the vambraces, the note from Xlinar and Drixiv is not required to start these quests. They simply are used to get the other NPCs who give the recommendations to talk about the quest.

